        }
        DESCRIPTION "Between missions for senior demons, Druia often works in the sex trade. She haunts her clients, who rarely seek help to dispel her. Many do not realize she is more than an exhausting dream, while those who do are unwilling to discuss the circumstances of their meeting."
    }

    #t1f1c8c5db24b17991a8437 ^"Gaap, a Prince of Hell" DEF {
